@startuml
title GitForge V1.0.0 - Repository Storage Creation Activity
start
:Receive authorized repository creation request;
:Validate repository name;
:Check namespace uniqueness;
if (Valid and unique?) then (yes)
    :Establish repository metadata;
    :Determine safe physical repository target;
    :Initialize physical Git repository;
    if (Physical initialization succeeds?) then (yes)
        :Persist/confirm consistent repository state;
        :Repository becomes available;
    else (no)
        :Handle storage creation failure;
        :Do not report repository as successfully available;
    endif
else (no)
    :Reject creation request;
endif
stop
@enduml
